.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH trust 1  "trust " 
.SH NAME
trust \- Manage execution trust for cloud snippets (Step 13): `trust list`, `trust revoke <owner/name>`, or approve an exact snippet directly: `trust <owner/name@hash>`
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBtrust\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fIREFERENCE\fR] [\fIsubcommands\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Manage execution trust for cloud snippets (Step 13): `trust list`, `trust revoke <owner/name>`, or approve an exact snippet directly: `trust <owner/name@hash>`
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
[\fIREFERENCE\fR]
Shorthand for `trust add`: `owner/name@hash` or `owner/name@version`
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
trust\-list(1)
List trusted cloud snippets
.TP
trust\-revoke(1)
Revoke trust for one snippet
.TP
trust\-add(1)
Approve an exact snippet without running it
.TP
trust\-help(1)
Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
.SH EXTRA
Examples:
  fg trust list
  fg trust alice/deploy@3
